  *     
  * ![359ddfcf-a2b1-4e59-ae54-5e76705d0adf.png](https://alidocs.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/res/Mp7ld7bZAb2VAOBQ/img/d69e38e4-5657-471d-aff6-1e6a4c269455.png)
  * *   Does not involve the image subject area
